{"ticker":"URI","updated":"2026-10-24T00:24:30Z","profile":{"longName":"United Rentals, Inc.","shortName":"United Rentals, Inc.","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Rental & Leasing Services","country":"United States","website":"https://www.unitedrentals.com","fullTimeEmployees":28600,"marketCap":68397027328,"trailingPE":25.419386,"forwardPE":18.425562,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":3.909295,"pegRatio":1.43,"targetMeanPrice":1292.2382,"targetHighPrice":1610.0,"targetLowPrice":950.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":21,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.157,"earningsGrowth":0.354,"grossMargins":0.39192,"operatingMargins":0.29205,"profitMargins":0.16329001,"totalRevenue":17496000512,"beta":1.826,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":1179.18,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":701.59,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.71},"summary":"United Rentals, Inc., through its subsidiaries, operates as an equipment rental company in the United States, Canada, Europe, Australia, and New Zealand. It operates through two segments, General Rentals and Specialty. The General Rentals segment rents general construction and industrial equipment, such as backhoes, skid-steer loaders, forklifts, earthmoving equipment, and material handling equipment; aerial work platforms, including boom and scissor lifts; and general tools and light equipment comprising pressure washers, water pumps, and power tools for construction and industrial companies, manufacturers, utilities, municipalities, homeowners, and government entities. The specialty segment rents trench safety equipment consists of trench shields, aluminum hydraulic shoring systems, slide rails, crossing plates, construction lasers, and line testing equipment for underground work; power and heating, ventilating, and air conditioning equipment, such as portable diesel generators, electrical distribution equipment, and temperature control equipment; fluid solutions equipment for fluid containment, transfer, and treatment; surface protection mats; and mobile storage equipment and modular office space. This segment serves construction companies involved in infrastructure projects, and municipalities and industrial companies. The company also sells aerial lifts, reach forklifts, t","summary_zh":"United Rentals, Inc. 透過其子公司在美國、加拿大、歐洲、澳洲和紐西蘭營運設備租賃公司。它透過兩個部門運作：普通租賃部門和專業租賃部門。一般租賃部門租賃一般建築和工業設備，例如反鏟挖土機、滑移裝載機、叉車、土方設備和物料搬運設備；高空作業平台，包括臂式升降機和剪叉式升降機；通用工具和輕型設備，包括用於建築和工業公司、製造商、公用事業、市政當局、房主和政府實體的高壓清洗機、水泵和電動工具。專業部門租賃溝槽安全設備，包括溝槽防護罩、鋁製液壓支撐系統、滑軌、交叉板、施工雷射和地下工程線路測試設備；電力和暖氣、通風和空調設備，例如便攜式柴油發電機、配電設備和溫度控制設備；用於流體容納、傳輸和處理的流體解決方案設備；表面保護墊；以及移動存儲設備和溫度控制設備。該部門為參與基礎設施項目的建築公司、市政當局和工業公司提供服務。公司也銷售高空作業平台、前移式堆高機、","sector_zh":"工業","industry_zh":"租賃服務","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":929.95,"h":946.0,"l":927.48,"c":939.49,"v":684500},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":936.13,"h":946.97,"l":931.64,"c":943.7,"v":799500},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":939.13,"h":951.54,"l":938.0,"c":949.34,"v":276900},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":952.97,"h":960.0,"l":947.21,"c":955.24,"v":527700},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":961.16,"h":961.16,"l":947.73,"c":956.34,"v":508100},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":943.37,"h":959.05,"l":935.02,"c":958.77,"v":468600},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":959.0,"h":965.0,"l":941.79,"c":945.26,"v":523600},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":948.92,"h":966.65,"l":947.87,"c":964.66,"v":405000},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":965.81,"h":980.53,"l":955.39,"c":975.23,"v":440200},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":973.41,"h":974.45,"l":959.06,"c":970.23,"v":585100},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":965.0,"h":965.42,"l":934.84,"c":945.33,"v":424600},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":948.58,"h":958.02,"l":940.94,"c":944.81,"v":540400},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":947.38,"h":970.57,"l":947.38,"c":959.59,"v":450100},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":954.71,"h":957.29,"l":936.4,"c":938.0,"v":535000},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":940.37,"h":957.75,"l":938.15,"c":947.9,"v":533000},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":960.66,"h":963.85,"l":941.0,"c":958.65,"v":447300},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":961.21,"h":967.4,"l":925.65,"c":931.01,"v":760200},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":940.95,"h":956.08,"l":936.0,"c":9